  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-15\">\n    <header class=\"article-header\">\n        <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 15</h2>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"article-content\">\n        <div class=\"article-text\">\n            <section class=\"paragraph\">\n                <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 1er.</h3>\n                <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n                    <p>L'article 8,</p>\n                    <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">et</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">est applicable aux conventions-cadres signées à partir du 12 septembre 2018, ou 12 mars 2018 en ce qui concerne les films d'animations et les séries télévisuelles d'animation, jusqu'au <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"4\" data-dossier-number=\"2022-02-14/06\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"22\">31 mars 2022</span> pour lesquelles l'attestation Tax Shelter n'a pas encore été demandée.</span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ol>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <section class=\"paragraph\">\n                <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 2.</h3>\n                <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n                    <p>Les articles 8, 6°, et 9 sont applicables aux conventions-cadres signées à partir du 12 mars 2018 jusqu'au <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"4\" data-dossier-number=\"2022-02-14/06\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"22\">31 mars 2022</span> pour lesquelles l'attestation Tax Shelter n'a pas encore été demandée.</p>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <section class=\"paragraph\">\n                <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 3.</h3>\n                <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n                    <p>Les articles 10 à 14 sont applicables aux conventions-cadres signées à partir du 12 mars 2020.</p>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n        <footer class=\"article-footer\">\n            <ol class=\"footnotes\">\n                <li class=\"footnote\" data-footnote-id=\"1\" data-dossier-number=\"2020-12-20/10\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"13\">\n                    <span class=\"footnote-text\">L <a href=\"https://www.ejustice.just.fgov.be/cgi_loi/article.pl?language=fr&lg_txt=f&cn_search=2020122010\">2020-12-20/10</a>, art. 13, 003; En vigueur : 09-01-2021</span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"footnote\" data-footnote-id=\"2\" data-dossier-number=\"2021-04-02/10\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"3\">\n                    <span class=\"footnote-text\">L <a href=\"https://www.ejustice.just.fgov.be/cgi_loi/article.pl?language=fr&lg_txt=f&cn_search=2021040210\">2021-04-02/10</a>, art. 3, 004; En vigueur : 01-04-2021</span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"footnote\" data-footnote-id=\"3\" data-dossier-number=\"2021-07-18/03\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"13\">\n                    <span class=\"footnote-text\">L <a href=\"https://www.ejustice.just.fgov.be/cgi_loi/article.pl?language=fr&lg_txt=f&cn_search=2021071803\">2021-07-18/03</a>, art. 13, 006; En vigueur : 01-07-2021</span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"footnote\" data-footnote-id=\"4\" data-dossier-number=\"2022-02-14/06\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"22\">\n                    <span class=\"footnote-text\">L <a href=\"https://www.ejustice.just.fgov.be/cgi_loi/article.pl?language=fr&lg_txt=f&cn_search=2022021406\">2022-02-14/06</a>, art. 22, 008; En vigueur : 07-03-2022</span>\n                </li>\n            </ol>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</article>",
